      "label": "mandatory vaccinations are equated with Hitler's authoritarian regime",
      "description": "The text 'mandatory vaccinations \"no exemptions\"' is mapped onto Adolf Hitler's image, implying that mandatory vaccination policies are as oppressive and totalitarian as the regime he led. This is a direct analogical mapping where the policy is projected onto the historical figure as a symbol of coercion and control.",
